{"seq":3,"slug":"proof-techniques","title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 证明技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/proof-techniques","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"理科方向-数学进阶-证明技巧\">理科方向 数学进阶 — 证明技巧</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数学证明是从已知公理和定理出发，通过逻辑推理得到新结论的过程。掌握多种证明方法和技巧是数学竞赛的核心能力，也是培养严密逻辑思维的最佳途径。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>直接证明</strong>：从条件出发，通过逻辑推理链直接到达结论。最常用的方法，适合条件和结论之间关系比较明确的情形。</li>\n<li><strong>反证法</strong>：假设结论不成立，推出矛盾。适用于&quot;至少存在&quot;、&quot;不超过&quot;等命题。</li>\n<li><strong>数学归纳法</strong>：证明基础步（n=1 成立），证明归纳步（假设 n=k 成立，推出 n=k+1 成立）。适用于与自然数相关的命题。</li>\n<li><strong>构造法</strong>：通过显式构造满足条件的对象来证明存在性。</li>\n<li><strong>极端原理</strong>：选择满足条件的极端元素（最大、最小、最长等），利用极端性质推导结论。</li>\n<li><strong>不变量与单色性</strong>：找到在变换过程中保持不变的量，或利用染色方案推出矛盾。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"反证法的典型应用\">反证法的典型应用</h3><p><strong>√2 是无理数的证明</strong>（经典反证法）：</p>\n<p>假设 √2 = p/q（p,q 为正整数且互素）。两边平方得 2 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/q^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，即</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，即</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，即</span></span></span></span></span>p^{2} = 2q^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>。因此</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">。因此</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。因此</span></span></span></span></span>p^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>是偶数，</mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext>是偶数，设</mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mtext>。代入得</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">是偶数，p 是偶数，设 p = 2k。代入得</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是偶数，</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是偶数，设</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">。代入得</span></span></span></span></span>4k^{2} = 2q^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>，即</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">，即</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，即</span></span></span></span></span>q^{2} = 2k^{2}$，q 也是偶数。这与 p,q 互素矛盾。</p>\n<p><strong>素数有无穷多个的证明</strong>（欧几里得反证法）：</p>\n<p>假设只有有限个素数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{1}, p_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, ..., <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。考虑 N = \n$\n$<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>p_{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">...p_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 1。N 不能被任何 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 整除（余数为 1），但 N &gt; 1 必有素因子，这个素因子不在 {<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,...,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>} 中，矛盾。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数学归纳法的变体\">数学归纳法的变体</h3><p><strong>普通归纳法</strong>：证 P(1)，证 P(k) → P(k+1)。</p>\n<p><strong>强归纳法</strong>：证 P(1)，证 P(1) ∧ P(2) ∧ ... ∧ P(k) → P(k+1)。即假设命题对所有不超过 k 的值成立。在递推关系依赖多个前项时必须使用。</p>\n<p><strong>结构归纳法</strong>：对递归定义的结构（树、表达式等）进行归纳。</p>\n<p><strong>无穷递降法</strong>：假设最小的反例存在，构造更小的反例，与最小性矛盾。本质上是对正整数的良序性的反向归纳。</p>\n<p><strong>归纳法的关键难点</strong>在于找到正确的&quot;增强命题&quot;。有时直接归纳原命题行不通，需要证明一个更强的命题，因为更强的归纳假设提供更多信息。</p>\n<p>例如：证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Σ_{k=1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>^{n} 1/k^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi><mtext>（</mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>）比直接证明</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 2 − 1/n（n ≥ 1）比直接证明 Σ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）比直接证明</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>1/k^{2}$ &lt; 2 容易得多，因为增强后的命题给出了误差项 1/n，使归纳步更容易推进。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不等式的证明技巧\">不等式的证明技巧</h3><p><strong>均值不等式链</strong>：调和平均 ≤ 几何平均 ≤ 算术平均 ≤ 平方平均，即 HM ≤ GM ≤ AM ≤ QM。等号成立的条件是所有变量相等。</p>\n<p><strong>柯西-施瓦茨不等式</strong>：(Σ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>b_{i}){}^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">≤ (Σ a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>^{2}<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">)(Σ b_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>^{2}$)。竞赛中最常用的不等式之一。几何直觉：两个向量的内积不超过模长之积。</p>\n<p><strong>排序不等式</strong>：顺序和 ≥ 乱序和 ≥ 逆序和。即两组数按相同顺序配对求和最大，按相反顺序配对最小。</p>\n<p><strong>Schur 不等式</strong>：对非负实数 a, b, c 和 t &gt; 0，有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(a−b)(a−c) + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(b−a)(b−c) + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>(c−a)(c−b) ≥ 0。t = 1 时的特殊形式在竞赛中经常出现。</p>\n<p><strong>SOS（Sum of Squares）方法</strong>：将待证不等式的差转化为若干完全平方和，从而证明非负性。对于对称不等式特别有效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"构造法与存在性证明\">构造法与存在性证明</h3><p>构造法通过显式给出满足条件的对象证明存在性。这需要创造力和对问题结构的深入理解。</p>\n<p><strong>经典构造</strong>：证明存在连续 n 个合数：n! + 2, n! + 3, ..., n! + (n+1) 都是合数（分别被 2, 3, ..., n+1 整除）。</p>\n<p><strong>概率方法</strong>（Erdős 方法）：证明满足某性质的对象存在，只需证明随机选取一个对象满足该性质的概率大于零。这是一种非构造性的存在性证明，在图论和组合中广泛应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"着色与不变量\">着色与不变量</h3><p><strong>棋盘着色</strong>：8×8 棋盘去掉两个对角的方格后，能否用 1×2 的骨牌铺满？将棋盘黑白着色，两个对角格同色，去掉后黑白格数不等（30 vs 32），而每个骨牌覆盖恰好一黑一白，因此不可能。</p>\n<p><strong>奇偶不变量</strong>：15-puzzle（华容道的数字版）中，逆序数的奇偶性是不变量。初始状态和目标状态的逆序数奇偶性不同时，问题无解。</p>\n<p><strong>模运算不变量</strong>：某些操作保持某个模的余数不变，利用这一点可以证明某些状态不可达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>用数学归纳法证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1^{3} + 2^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + ... + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = [n(n+1)/2]<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>证明：在任意 5 个整数中，必有 3 个的和能被 3 整除。（提示：考虑模 3 的余数和鸽巢原理）</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>利用柯西-施瓦茨不等式证明：对正实数 a, b, c，有 (a+b+c)(1/a + 1/b + 1/c) ≥ 9。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个 10×10 的棋盘上放置了 41 个 1×1 的棋子。证明可以找到一个 2×2 的区域，其中至少有 2 个棋子被放置。（提示：将棋盘分成 25 个 2×2 块）</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>数学证明的哲学基础是数理逻辑和公理化方法。哥德尔不完备定理（1931 年）指出在任何包含自然数算术的一致形式系统中，都存在不可证的真命题。这一深刻结果揭示了数学证明的固有局限性。</p>\n<p>计算机辅助证明正在改变数学研究的面貌。四色定理（1976 年）是第一个依赖计算机辅助证明的重要定理。近年来，形式化验证系统（如 Lean、Coq）使得数学家可以机器验证证明的正确性。2023 年 Terence Tao 等人使用 Lean 形式化了多项式弗赖曼-鲁齐猜想的证明。</p>\n<p>对于竞赛选手，Arthur Engel《Problem-Solving Strategies》和 Titu Andreescu《Putnam and Beyond》是经典的证明技巧参考书。每天坚持做 1-2 道竞赛证明题是提高水平的最有效方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>证明技巧是数学思维的最高体现。反证法、数学归纳法、构造法、不变量方法等不同工具各有适用场景，而选择合适的方法、构造关键的辅助对象，往往需要大量练习积累的直觉。数学证明的训练不仅服务于竞赛，更培养了在任何领域都弥足珍贵的严密推理能力和创造性思维。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 证明技巧","id":"理科方向-数学进阶-证明技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"反证法的典型应用","id":"反证法的典型应用"},{"level":3,"text":"数学归纳法的变体","id":"数学归纳法的变体"},{"level":3,"text":"不等式的证明技巧","id":"不等式的证明技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"构造法与存在性证明","id":"构造法与存在性证明"},{"level":3,"text":"着色与不变量","id":"着色与不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"理科方向 数学进阶 — 组合数学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/science-track/mathematics-advanced/competition-math/combinatorics"},"next":null}